  drivers: [com.alibaba.druid.mock.MockDriver, com.alibaba.druid.proxy.DruidDriver, org.h2.Driver]
  23:53:37.327 [main] INFO com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource -- {dataSource-1} inited
  filters: [com.alibaba.druid.filter.stat.StatFilter]
  count: 1
  sql stats: 3
  mbean DruidDataSource: 92 attributes
  mbean DruidDataSourceStat: 2 attributes
  mbean DruidDriver: 6 attributes
  mbean DruidStatService: 0 attributes
  mbean MockDriver: 6 attributes
  23:53:37.573 [main] INFO com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource -- {dataSource-1} closing ...
  23:53:37.575 [main] INFO com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource -- {dataSource-1} closed
  ```
  
